---
import type { Locale } from "../data/lang";
import { systems, strategyFor, quickCommand } from "../data/quick-install";
interface Props { locale: Locale }
const { locale } = Astro.props;
const zh = locale === "zh";
---
<div class="quick-install" id="quick-install">
  <article class="quick-card platform-install">
    <p class="eyebrow">INSTALL BY SYSTEM</p>
    <h3>{zh ? "选电视系统，再获取适用的安装方式。" : "Choose your TV system, then get the right installer."}</h3>
    <p>{zh ? "正式 APK v2.0.15：Sony 和标准 Android TV 优先标准版；TCL / 雷鸟中拒绝 HOME APK 的固件使用兼容守护版 Guard。小米等特殊固件先诊断。其他机型是否真正接管 Home，仍以实体遥控器和待机测试为准。" : "Official v2.0.15: Standard for Sony and ordinary Android TV; Compatibility Guard for TCL / FFalcon firmware that refuses HOME-declaring APKs. Diagnose Xiaomi and restricted firmware first. Hardware takeover is not assumed until physical remote and wake tests pass."}</p>
    <div class="install-selectors">
      <label>{zh ? "电脑系统" : "Computer"}<select id="install-host"><option value="powershell">Windows PowerShell</option><option value="posix">macOS / Linux</option></select></label>
      <label>{zh ? "电视系统 / 品牌" : "TV system / brand"}<select id="install-system">{systems.map(s => <option value={s.id}>{s[locale]}</option>)}</select></label>
      <label>{zh ? "操作" : "Action"}<select id="install-action"><option value="plan">{zh ? "先检测（不修改电视）" : "Inspect first (read-only)"}</option><option value="execute">{zh ? "检测后安装" : "Inspect and install"}</option></select></label>
    </div>
    {systems.map((system, i) => <div data-install-system={system.id} hidden={i !== 0}>
      {system.strategy ? <>
        <p>{strategyFor(system.id)?.guidance[locale]}</p>
        {system.id === "hisense" && <p>{zh ? "用户案例：海信电视通过 WorkBuddy 安装成功。型号与系统版本未提供，不代表所有海信或 VIDAA 都兼容。" : "User report: Tigris successfully installed on a Hisense TV using WorkBuddy. Model and OS version were not supplied; this does not certify every Hisense or VIDAA TV."}</p>}
        {system.id === "tcl" && <p>{zh ? "已用 Guard 的用户继续使用 Guard；遇到验证器拒绝时按下方手动说明走多屏互动（T-Cast）推送，不卸载绕过签名。" : "Existing Guard users should keep Guard. For verifier rejection, use the manual T-Cast push guide below; do not uninstall to bypass signing."}</p>}
        {system.id === "xiaomi" && <p>{zh ? "优先尝试标准版并测试实体 Home；如果仍回到 PatchWall，请按固件运行只读诊断。Guard 不是通用解锁方法，不要禁用 PatchWall。" : "Try Standard and verify the physical Home key. If PatchWall wins, diagnose exact firmware; Guard is not a universal unlock. Never disable PatchWall."}</p>}
        {["coocaa", "hisense", "oppo", "xgimi", "konka", "letv"].includes(system.id) && <p>{zh ? "这是 Android 9+ 机型的安全检查入口；先使用标准版，其他安装方式必须在确认该固件受限后使用。未通过实机验证的机型不要宣传为已接管。" : "This is a safe Android 9+ inspection path. Start with Standard; switch only after verifying firmware restrictions. The brand match is not hardware takeover certification."}</p>}

      </> : <p>{system.id === "webos"
        ? (zh ? "webOS 使用独立 IPK 测试版和 LG Developer Mode，不执行 Android APK / ADB 指令。" : "webOS uses a separate IPK preview and LG Developer Mode, not Android APK / ADB commands.")
        : (zh ? "当前没有此平台的一键桌面安装方案。先确认系统；不要对 Tizen、原生 VIDAA 或未知平台执行 Android APK / ADB 指令。" : "No one-click launcher installer is available for this platform. Confirm the OS first; do not run Android APK / ADB instructions on Tizen, native VIDAA or an unknown platform.")}</p>}
      {system.id === "webos" && <a class="text-link" href={zh ? "/webos/" : "/en/webos/"}>{zh ? "打开 LG webOS 独立安装指南" : "Open the separate LG webOS guide"} ↗</a>}
    </div>)}
    <div id="android-quick-commands">
      <p>{zh ? "先装好这三样，再运行命令。Windows 还要安装 Git for Windows，并把 Git Bash 和 adb 加入 PATH。电脑和电视同一个 Wi-Fi。把第一行地址改成电视上的四段数字。" : "Install these three first, then run the command. On Windows, also install Git for Windows and add Git Bash and adb to PATH. Use the same Wi-Fi. Replace the address on the first line with the four numbers from the TV."}</p>
      <ul class="tool-links">
        <li><a href="https://git-scm.com/downloads" rel="noopener noreferrer">Git</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://www.python.org/downloads/" rel="noopener noreferrer">Python 3</a></li>
        <li><a href="https://developer.android.com/tools/releases/platform-tools" rel="noopener noreferrer">{zh ? "Android SDK Platform-Tools（adb）" : "Android SDK Platform-Tools (adb)"}</a></li>
      </ul>
      {(["powershell", "posix"] as const).map(shell => (["plan", "execute"] as const).map(mode => <div data-install-command={`${shell}-${mode}`} hidden={shell !== "powershell" || mode !== "plan"}>
        <div class="code"><pre><code id={`quick-${shell}-${mode}`}>{quickCommand(shell, mode)}</code></pre><button class="copy" data-copy={`#quick-${shell}-${mode}`} type="button"><span class="label"></span></button></div>
      </div>))}
      <p class="fine">{zh ? "品牌选项用于说明差异；执行时读取电视的真实型号、固件与 HOME，再匹配统一策略库。安装不等于接管成功；实体 Home、开机与待机需分别验收。现有用户推荐在 Tigris 软件更新中覆盖升级，保留原安装包类型。 此处命令获取已发布 v2.0.15 安装器；机型细分诊断仅提供安全建议，具体固件仍需用户实测。" : "Brand choices explain differences; execution inspects the actual model, firmware and HOME against the shared registry. Installation is not takeover: verify physical Home, startup and wake separately. Existing users should update in place through Tigris Software Updates, retaining their APK flavor. These commands fetch the officially released v2.0.15 installer; firmware guidance is diagnostic until verified on the actual device."}</p>
      <p>{zh ? "恢复原桌面：保留原电脑的安装快照，在源码目录按下方说明执行 install.sh restore；不要凭品牌猜原桌面组件。" : "Recovery: keep the original computer's installation snapshot and follow the guide below to run install.sh restore from the source checkout. Never guess the original launcher by brand."}</p>
      <a class="text-link" href="/agent.md">{zh ? "安装前准备、专用安装与恢复说明" : "Preparation, special installation and recovery"} ↗</a>
    </div>
    <noscript>{zh ? "交互选择需要 JavaScript；也可直接使用下方手动安装说明。" : "Selectors need JavaScript; the manual installation guide below remains available."}</noscript>
  </article>
</div>
<style>
  .quick-install { display:block; }
  .install-selectors { display:flex; flex-wrap:wrap; gap:16px; margin:20px 0; }
  label { display:grid; gap:8px; flex:1 1 210px; min-width:0; }
  select { width:100%; min-width:0; padding:12px; border:1px solid rgba(0,0,0,.16); border-radius:10px; background:#fff; color:#1d1d1f; font:inherit; }
  [hidden] { display:none !important; }
</style>
